WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:05.378
TopoMarket maps market structure and tests whether topology can warn of sharp declines.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:13.647
Frozen retrospective: 29 of 66 pairs on 2008-08-29; 66 of 66 on 2008-10-10.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:18.022
Mean correlation rises from 0.791 to 0.911.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.649
Finance: eleven qualifying pairs.

00:00:21.669 --> 00:00:25.214
Mapper groups portfolios by shared structure.

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:32.167
March 10, 2025: a late-warning teaching example at percentile 100.

00:00:32.187 --> 00:00:37.846
Takens and H1 show the S&amp;P 500 return shape; the frozen threshold is 100.

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:40.250
Blind replay.

00:00:40.270 --> 00:00:46.976
Reveal: the index stayed above the 10% boundary, with a 2.02% maximum decline.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:52.316
Experimental: TDA 0 of 3, VIX 1 of 3.

00:00:52.336 --> 00:00:54.542
Average precision is low.

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:58.602
Explore the code and the live demo on GitHub.
